    [9518]={name="Mud's Crushers",quality=2,ilvl=36,reqLevel=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hungry!'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Mudcrush Durtfeet in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Mudcrush Durtfeet in northern Dustwallow wants 12 Mirefin Heads.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Hungry!",lore="Mud big ogre. Me hungry. Go bash fishy. Bring Mud food. You feed Mud or Mud eat you."},
    [9520]={name="Silent Hunter",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Call to Arms'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Drum Fel in Arathi Highlands. Objective: Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="Call to Arms",lore="The head of the beast is ready to be taken off... with great force. You have shown every sign that you are able to help us with this final mighty blow."},
    [9533]={name="Masons Fraternity Ring",quality=3,ilvl=49,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Divino-matic Rod'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Tanaris. Objective: Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Divino-matic Rod",lore="Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"},
    [9538]={name="Talvash's Gold Ring",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gnome Improvement'.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Gnome Improvement",lore="Listen, that ring is yours, sure..."},
    [9601]={name="Cushioned Boots",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sathrah's Sacrifice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Priestess A'moora in Darnassus. Objective: Priestess A'moora wants you to place Lady Sathrah's silvery spinnerets at the fountain inside the temple, and then return to her.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Sathrah's Sacrifice",lore="Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."},
    [9624]={name="Triprunner Dungarees",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rig Wars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nogg in Orgrimmar. Objective: Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9630]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9631]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9632]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9633]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Boots",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Mark of Quality'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jangdor Swiftstrider in Feralas. Objective: Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9639]={name="The Hand of Antu'sul",quality=3,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Antu'sul.",zone="Zul'Farrak",npc="Antu'sul"},
    [9647]={name="Failed Flying Experiment",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-22/FE!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rescue OOX-22/FE!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9651]={name="Gryphon Rider's Stormhammer",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Sharpbeak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gryphon Master Talonaxe in The Hinterlands. Objective: Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Saving Sharpbeak",lore="We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!"},
    [9652]={name="Gryphon Rider's Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=53,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Sharpbeak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gryphon Master Talonaxe in The Hinterlands. Objective: Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Saving Sharpbeak",lore="We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!"},
    [9680]={name="Tok'kar's Murloc Shanker",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Threat From the Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Katar in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Threat From the Sea",lore="Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."},
    [9686]={name="Spirit of the Faerie Dragon",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
    [9699]={name="Garrison Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=33,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Vahlarriel'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Desolace",questName="Return to Vahlarriel",lore="So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."},
